@startuml oid4vci_seq_user_init_ko
autonumber "<b>(#)</b>"
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 20
skinparam MaxMessageSize 400

actor "**사용자**" as user
participant "**월렛**" as wal <<Wallet>>
participant "**TAS**\n(List Provider)" as tas <<Server>>
box 발급 사업자 #AliceBlue
    participant "**Webview 발급**" as web <<Server>>
    participant "**Credential Issuer**" as ci <<Server>>
end box

== Issuer 탐색 ==
wal -> tas ++: Issuer 목록 조회
return {items[{credentialIssuer,\n credentialIssuerMetadataUri, userInitiationUri}]}
note right of tas
    ACTIVE 상태로 승인된 Issuer만 반환한다.
end note
user -> wal: 발급받을 Issuer 및 Credential 선택

== Webview 발급 ==
wal -> web ++: GET userInitiationUri\n{did = Holder DID, credential_configuration_id[, credential_type]}
    web -> web: 발급 세션 생성 (10분)
return Claim 입력 화면
user -> web: Claim 입력 및 확인
web -> web: 입력값 검증 및 Claim 저장
web -> ci: Credential Offer 생성\n(Pre-Authorized Code, tx_code 없음)
web --> wal: Redirect\nopenid-credential-offer://?credential_offer_uri=...

== Credential 발급 ==
wal -> ci: Credential Offer 조회 후 발급 진행\n(Token → Nonce → Credential)
note right of wal
    Pre-Authorized Code 흐름과 같으며
    tx_code 입력은 필요하지 않다.
end note
@enduml

